{
  "headline": "Read a book + make art!",
  "body_html": "<p>Please reach out if you’d like me to facilitate an art workshop! As an art therapist, I believe the art process can help foster mental, emotional, and spiritual growth.</p><p>*Disclaimer: These art workshops are not art therapy. If you’re looking for art therapy, please visit the <a href=\"https://arttherapy.org/art-therapist-locator/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">American Art Therapy Association Art Therapist Locator</a> to find a registered art therapist in your area.*</p>",
